{"id":"querida","lemma":"querida","pos":"noun","rank":431,"glosses":["dear, honey, darling","mistress"],"ipa":"/keˈɾida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"queridas","masculine":"querido","masculinePlural":"queridos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-querida.wav","formAudio":{"querido":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-querido.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ella era querida por todos en la villa.","en":"She was loved by everybody in the village.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"small town"}]},{"text":"Nunca he querido hacer eso.","en":"I've never wanted to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512080","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Siempre te he querido.","en":"I've always loved you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104790","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Siempre he querido ver tu casa.","en":"I've always wanted to see your house.","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"Tienes que cuidar de tus seres queridos.","en":"You need to look after your loved ones.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688909","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to look after"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}